    "detailed_description": "<h1>Add to wishlist!</h1><p></p><br><h1>Check other games:</h1><p><br><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594400/extras/1b0f1cd51c0cbf09c2f002ea859e8c06.poster.avif?t=1728829839\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594400/extras/1b0f1cd51c0cbf09c2f002ea859e8c06.webm?t=1728829839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594400/extras/1b0f1cd51c0cbf09c2f002ea859e8c06.mp4?t=1728829839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>In the <strong>GAI Stops Auto</strong> you will become a traffic police officer. Stop cars and check for violations. You can communicate with drivers in different ways. Write out fines for drivers or take a bribe - it's up to you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Events</strong></h2>Sometimes unpredictable events will occur around you. You must be willing to overcome them. Watch out for the police boss. Beware of wild muscular guys and animals! Explore the space around. Find secret objects.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594400/extras/6f23f875ace8c72ee86e957947234c27.poster.avif?t=1728829839\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594400/extras/6f23f875ace8c72ee86e957947234c27.webm?t=1728829839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594400/extras/6f23f875ace8c72ee86e957947234c27.mp4?t=1728829839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Story</strong></h2>Complete the missions and go through the story of a police officer. Reach the end and find out how it all ends!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594400/extras/004fe0c4273e73b7d5a18b9151d1ecca.avif?t=1728829839\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Car traffic system<br></li><li>Dialogs<br></li><li>Epic story<br></li><li>Meme characters<br></li><li>Fun events</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594400/extras/1b0f1cd51c0cbf09c2f002ea859e8c06.poster.avif?t=1728829839\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594400/extras/1b0f1cd51c0cbf09c2f002ea859e8c06.webm?t=1728829839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594400/extras/1b0f1cd51c0cbf09c2f002ea859e8c06.mp4?t=1728829839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>In the <strong>GAI Stops Auto</strong> you will become a traffic police officer. Stop cars and check for violations. You can communicate with drivers in different ways. Write out fines for drivers or take a bribe - it's up to you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Events</strong></h2>Sometimes unpredictable events will occur around you. You must be willing to overcome them. Watch out for the police boss. Beware of wild muscular guys and animals! Explore the space around. Find secret objects.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594400/extras/6f23f875ace8c72ee86e957947234c27.poster.avif?t=1728829839\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594400/extras/6f23f875ace8c72ee86e957947234c27.webm?t=1728829839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594400/extras/6f23f875ace8c72ee86e957947234c27.mp4?t=1728829839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Story</strong></h2>Complete the missions and go through the story of a police officer. Reach the end and find out how it all ends!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594400/extras/004fe0c4273e73b7d5a18b9151d1ecca.avif?t=1728829839\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Car traffic system<br></li><li>Dialogs<br></li><li>Epic story<br></li><li>Meme characters<br></li><li>Fun events</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Become the lord of this road! Put things in order in the traffic! Write out fines for violators and do not fall into the gachi trap...",
